!! Writing the specs

Finally we can profit from our modularization. Recall our journey started with a problem statement: automate copying and renaming classes from pharo-eda develop, to the new pharo-eda modules.

The specification format was defined in Chapter04:

[[[
input package,input class,output module,output package,output class
]]]

